			"notes": "# Prerelease Notes\nHi all, I'm releasing this version as it has features I believe would be valuable to the community, the main one being integration with SpeedrunIGT. (tested with version 11.4)\nCurrently, there's only a 1.7.10 build available.\n\nThe main reason this is going out early is that I probably won't have much time to work on this mod, at least not for the next few weeks. I will definitely get around to it sometime, but I'm taking a bit of a break.\n\n- Adds an \"End Fight\" category when used with SpeedrunIGT, this makes the timer active while fighting the dragon.\n- You no longer need cheats enabled to run any command.\n- You should use SpeedrunIGT 11.4+ for maximum compatibility."
		},
